WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.308 --> 00:00:03.630
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.463
- Oh my god.

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:05.296
It's the intro.

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:06.906
This is so exciting.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.925
Oh, hi, I'm Megan and
recently I completed six items

00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:12.393
off my bucket list in six days.

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:14.614
And now I just want to give
someone else the opportunity

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.190
to live their best lives.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.895
The point isn't to
complete your bucket list.

00:00:17.895 --> 00:00:19.261
It's just to get a running start.

00:00:19.261 --> 00:00:22.496
This week we're gonna go on an
adventure with Ryann Graham.

00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:24.482
He's a video producer here at BuzzFeed

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:28.210
and the most joyful, smiliest
person you will ever meet.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.084
Come on in, Ryann.

00:00:29.084 --> 00:00:30.881
- Aw, That was really nice.

00:00:30.881 --> 00:00:32.355
I didn't know what you were gonna say.

00:00:32.355 --> 00:00:34.124
Did you put your feet in this?

00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:34.983
- Not all of 'em.

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:36.659
So, if you were to cross off three things

00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:38.401
from your bucket list, what would they be?

00:00:38.401 --> 00:00:40.159
- First, I would love to go drag racing.

00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:43.251
I'm a bit of a control
freak so it would be

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:45.453
really hard for me to
be in a passenger seat

00:00:45.453 --> 00:00:48.875
going 100 miles an hour and
just trusting and letting go.

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:50.222
The second thing I want to do is stay

00:00:50.222 --> 00:00:52.031
in an actual haunted
house, but I think there's

00:00:52.031 --> 00:00:53.809
something about being
in something that has

00:00:53.809 --> 00:00:56.639
actually experienced
tragedy or something scary.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:57.472
Like, I don't know.

00:00:57.472 --> 00:00:59.360
Could you imagine being
taken over by a ghost?

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:00.744
- I prefer not to.

00:01:00.744 --> 00:01:02.953
- My third thing, not to be
confused with drag racing,

00:01:02.953 --> 00:01:05.401
is to dress and perform in drag.

00:01:05.401 --> 00:01:07.479
That's probably my ultimate
bucket list item, honestly.

00:01:07.479 --> 00:01:08.789
- I mean, if you're not busy this week

00:01:08.789 --> 00:01:10.200
I think we can make that happen.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.033
- Really?

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.071
- Drag racing tomorrow?

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.695
- Oh, tomorrow?

00:01:13.695 --> 00:01:16.070
But we have to finish all these first?

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.715
- Oh, yeah, they were very expensive.

00:01:17.715 --> 00:01:19.006
- Alright.

00:01:19.006 --> 00:01:20.159
More fries.

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:22.742
(upbeat music)

00:01:25.656 --> 00:01:28.159
- What a beautiful day to
scare the shit outta Ryann.

00:01:28.159 --> 00:01:30.141
Today we're at Exotic Racing in Montana

00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:31.936
where Ryann with be in the passenger seat

00:01:31.936 --> 00:01:35.112
of a vehicle going over
125 miles per hour.

00:01:35.112 --> 00:01:36.195
But what he doesn't know

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.788
is when he's gonna be taking off.

00:01:37.788 --> 00:01:39.892
So, I've told the driver
to basically pretend

00:01:39.892 --> 00:01:42.206
like he's gonna take some
time to show him the buttons.

00:01:42.206 --> 00:01:44.162
Let me show you what these
things do, and then boom.

00:01:44.162 --> 00:01:46.928
He's gonna take off, scare
the shit out of Ryann.

00:01:46.928 --> 00:01:49.136
'Cause that's what this
is all about, right?

00:01:49.136 --> 00:01:49.969
Right?

00:01:49.969 --> 00:01:51.216
Why is this on your bucket list and

00:01:51.216 --> 00:01:52.907
why must you do this before you die?

00:01:52.907 --> 00:01:54.451
- I'm a little bit of a control freak.

00:01:54.451 --> 00:01:57.033
After today, I'm hoping that
this feeling of letting go

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.262
and trusting bleeds into
other areas of my life.

00:01:59.262 --> 00:02:00.095
I don't know.

00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:00.928
It'll be fun or I'll die.

00:02:00.928 --> 00:02:03.518
Either way, what's the
worst that could happen?

00:02:03.518 --> 00:02:05.933
Stop, you're making me nervous.

00:02:05.933 --> 00:02:07.458
Stop it, Megan.

00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:08.291
- Let's do it.

00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:09.553
- Alright, let's go.

00:02:09.553 --> 00:02:10.641
- Do people crash?

00:02:10.641 --> 00:02:12.277
- You know, if I told you no I'd be lying.

00:02:12.277 --> 00:02:13.110
You ready?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.679
- As ready as I'll ever be.

00:02:14.679 --> 00:02:15.877
- So, what we have here in front

00:02:15.877 --> 00:02:18.079
of us is a 1.2 mile road course.

00:02:18.079 --> 00:02:19.449
- I thought it was gonna be straight away.

00:02:19.449 --> 00:02:20.282
- Not at all.

00:02:20.282 --> 00:02:21.121
- Whoa!

00:02:21.121 --> 00:02:22.688
Okay. Okay.

00:02:22.688 --> 00:02:23.753
Okay, okay.

00:02:23.753 --> 00:02:24.586
Holy crap!

00:02:25.627 --> 00:02:26.460
Oh my god.

00:02:27.756 --> 00:02:28.589
I got this. I got this.

00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:29.422
- Hang on. Hang on.

00:02:29.422 --> 00:02:31.396
- Whoa, we're not, holy shit!

00:02:31.396 --> 00:02:34.198
Oh, this is so fun, but so scary.

00:02:34.198 --> 00:02:37.303
Oh my god, we're going like 120, 130?

00:02:37.303 --> 00:02:38.453
(screams)

00:02:38.453 --> 00:02:39.819
(car horn honks)

00:02:39.819 --> 00:02:41.548
(Megan laughs)

00:02:41.548 --> 00:02:42.694
- [Megan] He looked horrified.

00:02:42.694 --> 00:02:44.436
(camera shutter clicks)

00:02:44.436 --> 00:02:45.450
- What did ya think, Ryann?

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.735
- That was so fun.

00:02:46.735 --> 00:02:48.379
Holy crap, wow!

00:02:48.379 --> 00:02:49.867
This was like this coolest thing

00:02:49.867 --> 00:02:51.126
I think I've ever done in my life.

00:02:51.126 --> 00:02:52.877
It was such a freeing experience.

00:02:52.877 --> 00:02:55.940
I had to just be in the
car and let it happen.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.124
But if that's how day one was

00:02:57.124 --> 00:02:58.307
I can only imagine how day two

00:02:58.307 --> 00:02:59.160
and day three are gonna be.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.638
Thank you so much.

00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:01.471
- Of course.

00:03:01.471 --> 00:03:02.857
Let's go on to day two.

00:03:02.857 --> 00:03:04.009
Let's go!

00:03:04.009 --> 00:03:06.230
Take the helmet, just take it.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:07.688
So, Ryann is really jazzed

00:03:07.688 --> 00:03:08.977
to stay somewhere haunted tonight,

00:03:08.977 --> 00:03:11.061
but what he doesn't know
is that I've booked us

00:03:11.061 --> 00:03:13.029
the most notoriously haunted room

00:03:13.029 --> 00:03:16.314
in the most notoriously
haunted boat in America.

00:03:16.314 --> 00:03:17.344
The Queen Mary.

00:03:17.344 --> 00:03:18.844
- Are we ready to go yet?

00:03:18.844 --> 00:03:20.080
- Yep.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:24.433
- [Megan] Alright, take a step
up, up, yep, there you go.

00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:27.212
Do you remember saying that being

00:03:27.212 --> 00:03:28.286
afraid made you feel alive?

00:03:28.286 --> 00:03:29.119
- Yeah.
- That's what you're

00:03:29.119 --> 00:03:30.124
looking for?
- Yes.

00:03:30.124 --> 00:03:32.874
- Yeah, okay, just remember that.

00:03:34.096 --> 00:03:35.219
- Holy crap.

00:03:35.219 --> 00:03:36.055
That's the Queen Mary.

00:03:36.055 --> 00:03:37.390
- Why is this on your bucket list?

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:39.062
Why do you want to be haunted so bad?

00:03:39.062 --> 00:03:41.207
- Something about being around
ghosts and being scared,

00:03:41.207 --> 00:03:45.714
that fear is like so thrilling
that it makes you feel alive.

00:03:45.714 --> 00:03:47.700
Part of me hopes you get
possessed so I can be like.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.533
That way I can interact.

00:03:48.533 --> 00:03:50.152
- Let's just go take the tour.

00:03:50.152 --> 00:03:52.213
- My name is Commodore Everette Hoard.

00:03:52.213 --> 00:03:56.603
This ship carried 2.5 million
passengers back and forth

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:59.924
across the Atlantic, in war, in peace.

00:03:59.924 --> 00:04:01.421
A lot of those guys that went over

00:04:01.421 --> 00:04:03.327
on this ship did not come home.

00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:05.414
Some of their last memories were scratched

00:04:05.414 --> 00:04:08.876
into the hand rails all the
way around the top of the ship.

00:04:08.876 --> 00:04:09.894
- I don't like that.

00:04:09.894 --> 00:04:11.025
I don't like any of this.

00:04:11.025 --> 00:04:13.916
- This ship has a wonderful,
happy presence about it,

00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:16.341
and a lot of people do have experiences.

00:04:16.341 --> 00:04:17.434
I hear people talk.

00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:19.770
I heard one speak in 2011.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:20.740
- What did they say to you?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.506
- She said, "I'm so cold.

00:04:22.506 --> 00:04:24.343
"I'm so very cold."
- Did you get her a blanket?

00:04:24.343 --> 00:04:27.183
- [Commodore] We're
gonna go to cabin B340.

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:28.466
- [Megan] That's where
we're sleeping tonight.

00:04:28.466 --> 00:04:29.494
- Oh, good.

00:04:29.494 --> 00:04:31.230
If there's anything that will happen,

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.171
it'll be in B340.

00:04:33.171 --> 00:04:37.338
We're going further and
further beneath the sea, now.

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.418
- [Ryann] I don't like this.

00:04:40.418 --> 00:04:41.563
Are you doing that on purpose?

00:04:41.563 --> 00:04:42.396
- [Camera Man] Oh I don't know.

00:04:42.396 --> 00:04:43.902
But I was getting a strobing effect

00:04:43.902 --> 00:04:45.683
on my camera too and I was just like--

00:04:45.683 --> 00:04:47.583
- [Camera Man] Yeah, I didn't
realize that's what it was.

00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:49.574
- [Ryann] Ooo, was that
doing that upstairs?

00:04:49.574 --> 00:04:50.977
- [Camera Man] No.

00:04:50.977 --> 00:04:54.706
It was just happening by that thing.

00:04:54.706 --> 00:04:56.680
- So, you wouldn't stay in this room

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.756
is what you're telling me.

00:04:57.756 --> 00:04:58.589
- No.

00:04:58.589 --> 00:05:01.160
When I would go in there,
there were so many reports

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.535
of incidents happening in the cabin

00:05:03.535 --> 00:05:06.215
that they finally stopped
renting it out to people.

00:05:06.215 --> 00:05:09.298
People had reported
lights turning on and off,

00:05:09.298 --> 00:05:11.267
water starting, water stopping.

00:05:11.267 --> 00:05:12.350
- No, no, no.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.405
- Oh, did you hear that?

00:05:17.405 --> 00:05:18.250
What is that?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.954
- [Megan] Don't. (laughs)

00:05:19.954 --> 00:05:21.202
- No.
(Megan screams)

00:05:21.202 --> 00:05:23.300
- Oh my god, Everette did it.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.409
(laughing)

00:05:25.409 --> 00:05:29.576
- The thing is neither of us
tried to protect each other.

00:05:31.666 --> 00:05:33.792
Is there a number to
call if anything happens?

00:05:33.792 --> 00:05:34.676
- Not mine.

00:05:34.676 --> 00:05:36.016
- Alright, let's go in.

00:05:36.016 --> 00:05:37.192
- Okay, um...

00:05:37.192 --> 00:05:38.324
- Oh, you're gonna go in there right now?

00:05:38.324 --> 00:05:39.157
- Yeah.

00:05:39.157 --> 00:05:40.740
- I'm needed on the bridge.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.340
- Okay, bye.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.247
- Ooh, I don't like this.

00:05:44.247 --> 00:05:45.497
Oh, okay, okay.

00:05:46.869 --> 00:05:48.463
It's just a little creepy.

00:05:48.463 --> 00:05:51.362
Oh, that can't be a thing.

00:05:51.362 --> 00:05:53.213
That freaked me out.

00:05:53.213 --> 00:05:55.725
Is this, okay, I feel
like I can stay here.

00:05:55.725 --> 00:05:56.648
It don't smell like new.

00:05:56.648 --> 00:05:57.902
It smell like death.

00:05:57.902 --> 00:05:59.278
- [Megan] What are those doors?

00:05:59.278 --> 00:06:00.457
- I don't know.

00:06:00.457 --> 00:06:04.914
See now, if something pops
out at me, I swear to god.

00:06:04.914 --> 00:06:06.619
- [Megan] This is just
a (gasps) oh my god.

00:06:06.619 --> 00:06:07.599
See.

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:08.502
- I didn't know.

00:06:08.502 --> 00:06:10.514
I didn't know what was gonna be in there.

00:06:10.514 --> 00:06:11.478
- What?

00:06:11.478 --> 00:06:14.432
- No, that was a real noise.

00:06:14.432 --> 00:06:15.265
Hold on.

00:06:15.265 --> 00:06:18.432
Cause it like, it came from over here.

00:06:19.876 --> 00:06:22.461
You mean you don't hear
that like knocking?

00:06:22.461 --> 00:06:24.157
Megan, stop playing.

00:06:24.157 --> 00:06:24.990
No, literally.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.407
Wait, wait, wait.

00:06:27.272 --> 00:06:29.753
Okay, maybe, I swear I heard a knock.

00:06:29.753 --> 00:06:31.541
- If you fall asleep I'm waking you up.

00:06:31.541 --> 00:06:32.578
- Okay, this is home.

00:06:32.578 --> 00:06:34.038
This is gonna be home.

00:06:34.038 --> 00:06:34.871
- I hate you.

00:06:34.871 --> 00:06:37.380
- Alright, crew, so it's
just gonna be me and Megan.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.314
- And the ghosts.

00:06:38.314 --> 00:06:39.922
- And the ghosts, and all the ghosts.

00:06:39.922 --> 00:06:42.106
Like review the footage immediately.

00:06:42.106 --> 00:06:43.368
- But don't tell us what you saw.

00:06:43.368 --> 00:06:45.451
- Oh my god, no, tell me.

00:06:49.155 --> 00:06:50.108
Let's do this.

00:06:50.108 --> 00:06:51.640
- [Megan] Do we have to sit on the floor?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.473
- Yeah, what?

00:06:52.473 --> 00:06:53.508
You can't do this on the bed.

00:06:53.508 --> 00:06:55.566
- [Megan] The floor feels dangerous.

00:06:55.566 --> 00:06:56.399
- Come on.

00:06:58.205 --> 00:07:00.788
Is anyone in this room with us?

00:07:02.063 --> 00:07:04.014
I hate you, I hate you,
I hate you, I hate you.

00:07:04.014 --> 00:07:05.519
- I think you're moving it.

00:07:05.519 --> 00:07:08.985
- Are you gonna scare us tonight?

00:07:08.985 --> 00:07:10.487
What? Look at you.

00:07:10.487 --> 00:07:12.852
(both laughing)

00:07:12.852 --> 00:07:17.041
- Dear ghostie, are you
living a happy life?

00:07:17.041 --> 00:07:17.874
- Stop.

00:07:17.874 --> 00:07:18.789
You're doing that.
- You're doing that.

00:07:18.789 --> 00:07:19.622
You, stop.

00:07:19.622 --> 00:07:20.462
You know you're doing that.

00:07:20.462 --> 00:07:22.295
- I'm not doing that.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.003
Oh my god.

00:07:25.955 --> 00:07:27.517
We're done.

00:07:27.517 --> 00:07:29.484
For my mental health we're
keeping the light on.

00:07:29.484 --> 00:07:30.461
- Let's do this.

00:07:30.461 --> 00:07:31.427
- Okay, good night.

00:07:31.427 --> 00:07:32.365
- Good night.

00:07:32.365 --> 00:07:35.365
(suspenseful music)

00:07:45.313 --> 00:07:46.396
- What is it?

00:07:52.057 --> 00:07:54.246
- [Megan] I want to scare them.

00:07:54.246 --> 00:07:57.163
(knocking at door)

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:11.821
(rapping at door)

00:08:13.851 --> 00:08:17.525
Yeah, I think I scared
the shit outta them.

00:08:17.525 --> 00:08:19.115
- It's funny 'cause we
thought we were gonna

00:08:19.115 --> 00:08:22.766
find ghosts, but we end up
becoming the ghosts instead.

00:08:22.766 --> 00:08:24.097
I slept surprisingly well.

00:08:24.097 --> 00:08:25.555
It was cool to get to be here

00:08:25.555 --> 00:08:27.645
and have those moments
of fear and just like

00:08:27.645 --> 00:08:28.902
get over and conquer it.

00:08:28.902 --> 00:08:30.555
- I'm really glad that
you're getting to check

00:08:30.555 --> 00:08:32.252
this off your bucket
list and I'm really glad

00:08:32.252 --> 00:08:35.036
that I never have to come here again.

00:08:35.036 --> 00:08:37.758
So, today Ryann is being
transformed into a drag queen,

00:08:37.758 --> 00:08:39.086
but what I haven't told him is

00:08:39.086 --> 00:08:42.085
that he's gonna perform for
all of our coworkers tomorrow.

00:08:42.085 --> 00:08:43.485
But we'll tell him that later.

00:08:43.485 --> 00:08:45.985
Alright, Ryann, I've
brought in the one and only,

00:08:45.985 --> 00:08:47.659
most wonderful LA queen.

00:08:47.659 --> 00:08:49.593
- Anita Procedure!

00:08:49.593 --> 00:08:50.426
Hi!

00:08:50.426 --> 00:08:51.259
- Hey, how are you?

00:08:51.259 --> 00:08:52.509
- Oh, it's so good to meet you, Ryann.

00:08:52.509 --> 00:08:53.931
- It's good to meet you.
- Hi, darling.

00:08:53.931 --> 00:08:56.441
- Cause I feel like
there's so much confidence

00:08:56.441 --> 00:08:58.374
- 'Cause I feel like
there's so much confidence

00:08:58.374 --> 00:09:00.506
you have to have when
you're performing drag

00:09:00.506 --> 00:09:02.395
and being a drag queen, and I feel like

00:09:02.395 --> 00:09:04.184
I don't know if I necessarily have.

00:09:04.184 --> 00:09:05.914
I was closeted for so long in my life

00:09:05.914 --> 00:09:07.601
that it's a part of me that I feel like

00:09:07.601 --> 00:09:09.504
I want to explore and push more.

00:09:09.504 --> 00:09:11.263
- Today is part of your drag training.

00:09:11.263 --> 00:09:12.781
We are going to be going
over walking in heels,

00:09:12.781 --> 00:09:15.093
We are gonna be going
over walking in heels,

00:09:15.093 --> 00:09:17.194
for your performance tomorrow.

00:09:17.194 --> 00:09:18.727
- My performance?

00:09:18.727 --> 00:09:20.059
- I'll leave you guys to it.

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:21.742
- It's gonna be great.

00:09:21.742 --> 00:09:22.575
It's a little kick ball change.

00:09:22.575 --> 00:09:23.408
It's a little one two step in
front of your coworker, okay?

00:09:23.408 --> 00:09:25.391
It's a little one two step in
front of your coworkers, okay?

00:09:25.391 --> 00:09:26.224
- Alright, let's get to it.
Let's get rehearsing, honey.

00:09:26.224 --> 00:09:27.134
- Alright, let's get to it.

